"P1969134803" "Re-Historian"
// DetailString :
"P3746560650" "While uploading the program to overwrite the history files in the library you noticed a pattern in some of the stories about Marcus Cole during the Hamidon Wars. Any nation that was attacked by the Devouring Earth, and nearly destroyed, was saved in the nick of time by Cole. But the most curious thing about it is that the history books talk about how closely allied these nations were with Cole, and yet, the information Dr. Arvin had you upload contradicts this, pointing out that they were actually bitter enemies."

