"P4247973433" "Hack Cameras"
// SendOffString :
"P3850116676" "We only need a few of the cameras to be hacked.  Mainly we are just looking to observe the movement of PPD patrols and critical personnel entering and leaving their offices. But the added benefit of these little devices are that we can override the video feed of the cameras at any time, thus masking our own movement in the area, incase we need to get someone in or out."

